# Sigelith Hourglass - the clock of an independent operator (README.md, "An independent
# operator's clock"). Copy as deploy/operator.env in the operator's package; install.sh reads only
# these two keys. Without the file, install.sh works as on the Sigelith server.
#
# Operator identifier (SPEC.md section 7): 1 to 64 characters a-z 0-9 . -, customarily the
# operator's domain. It goes into the genesis for good.
OPERATOR=example.org
# The v1 data directory (owned by the hourglass user, mode 750).
DATA_V1=/srv/sigelith-hourglass-v1
